<MATH_0039>\ncontaining <MATH_0040> such that <MATH_0041> and <MATH_0042>\nare contained in <MATH_0043>. The morphisms <MATH_0044>\nand <MATH_0045> into <MATH_0046> correspond to ring maps\n<MATHSEG_0001>and<MATHSEG_0002>\nwhich agree as maps into <MATH_0047>. By the short exact sequence\ndisplayed above there is a unique lift of these ring homomorphism\nto a ring map <MATH_0048> as desired.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:6e5b927c1b101fc013e07f2baac720384f3f3387b123cf73afcb695657e91c93", "unit_id": "tag:0C4J:proof"}
